0,Amdo Tibetan - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amdo_Tibetan,"Amdo Tibetan (Tibetan script: ཨ་མདོའི་སྐད་, Wylie: A-mdo’i skad, Lhasa dialect: [ámtokɛʔ]; also called Am kä) is the Tibetic language spoken in Amdo (now mostly in Qinghai, some in Ngawa and Gannan).","Tibetan, Amdo",Sino-Tibetan
