9,"Tibetan, Amdo | Accent Network",https://accentnetwork.com/tibetan-amdo/,"Amdo Tibetan is one of the major varieties of the Tibetan language, part of the Sino-Tibetan language family. It is primarily spoken in the Amdo region, which spans parts of Qinghai, Sichuan, and Gansu provinces in China, with around 1.8 million speakers.","Tibetan, Amdo",Sino-Tibetan
